= Bioinformatics — Simple =

Bioinformatics uses computing, mathematics, and statistics to work with biological data. It includes databases, algorithms, sequence analysis, genomics, software, and reproducible workflows.

'''Important boundary:''' bioinformatics ≠ sequence analysis only.

